      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَيْلَجٌ</span></b>  [The <i>cocoon of a silk-worm;</i>] the <i>thing
from which</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَزّ</span> <i>is obtained:</i> an arabicized word;
[from the Pers. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">پِيلَهْ</span> <i>pélah;</i> but said to be] originally <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَيْلَق</span>, and thus some pronounce it. (Msb,)

